                <p style="text-align: justify; margin: 4px 0 8px 0;"><b>Specific Objective:</b> Mediation: Text: Simplify textbook content for peers. Concept: Use visual aids to explain basic concepts.</p>
                <p style="text-align: justify; margin: 4px 0 8px 0;"><b>Learning Outcome:</b> Mediation: Can simplify content on chores for their peers, using simple words and pictures (e.g., "Cleaning is making things tidy." while showing a tidy room image). Can use visual aids to explain household chores (e.g., points to a clean room picture for "cleaning"). Can help classmates understand chores, using gestures (e.g., mimes sweeping for "We sweep.").</p>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
